  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given roots of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are distinct and lies in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> Following conditions must be true<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>29</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br />Taking intersection of all conditions, we get <math><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a8075e17-6564-4f9a-b182-69e91ed46a96-image.png\" style=\"width: 285px; height: 215px;\" /></p>",
